  "format": "ai-tools",
  "script": "Hugging Face's free AI asks who you are, looks you up, then builds your website.\n\nIt's called HuggingChat, and Hugging Face is moving its website builder, DeepSite, in here. It's free to start, which is where the catch comes in.\n\nStart with Make my website. Tell it your name, what you do, your links and a style.\n\nThen it reads those links, or searches your name if you skip them, and writes the whole page while you watch.\n\nAsk for a change and it edits only that part.\n\nOnce you like it, one tap puts it online as a free Hugging Face Space, with its own link.\n\nThe catch: a free account gets ten cents of AI credit a month. One user says theirs was gone in two questions. Pro costs nine dollars monthly and gives you twenty times that.\n\nSo plan your changes and build it in one sitting. Save this, and build yours this weekend.",
